        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message14> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk152> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To facilitate drafting and suggestion of actions or steps in administrative processes, our company's can employ our preferred sovereign model, Mistral 7B Instruct, which provides strong French-language performance and is self-hostable to generate text based on the context provided by the user's query or task. our company's experience with contract review and clause extraction in the legal sector, as well as clinical guideline assistance in healthcare, demonstrates our company's ability to develop tailored AI solutions for specific domains." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message14> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk153> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For explicability and transparency, our company's will implement explainability tools such as SHAP for classification models or source citation through RAG grounding. implement ensures that recommendations or proposals issued by the system can be understood and traced back to recommendations or proposals issued by the system origins, aligning with the client's requirements for explicability and transparency." ;
