    <http://example.org/node/chunk154> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our company's past AI use cases in public administration, legal, healthcare, and smart city domains, our company's are confident in our company's ability to adapt our company's AI solutions to meet the specific needs of the City of Belval. our company's average accuracy gain from fine-tuning of 12% suggests that our company's can significantly improve the system performance on the client's specific tasks." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message14> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk155> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of performance benchmarks, our company's typical retrieval precision at 5 is 0.87, and our company's answer relevance score is 0.84, indicating strong capabilities in information retrieval and generation. our company's low hallucination rate of 2.1% further supports the reliability of our company's AI-generated content. our company's acknowledge the known trade-offs between explicability and performance, as well as online learning versus GDPR compliance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message14> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk156> a prov:Entity ;
