        ex:hasText "To align with the City's sustainability goals, our company's, can leverage our company's existing strengths in sustainability. our company's have an EcoVadis rating of Silver with a score of 62, indicating a good level of commitment to sustainability practices. our company's carbon footprint is also relatively low, with total Scope 1 and 2 emissions at 148 tCO2e. our company's can ensure our proposed solution hosting is environmentally friendly by utilizing our company's green hosting partners, such as OVHcloud and Scaleway, both located in France and using 100% renewable energy. utilizing aligns with reducing carbon footprint and supports sustainable development. our company's digital sobriety practices, including INT8/INT4 model quantisation, auto-scaling to zero outside business hours, query result caching, and green IT hardware procurement policy, can help minimize the energy consumption of our proposed solution." ;
