    <http://example.org/node/chunk79> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, it is essential to note that some requirements may not be fully covered due to technical constraints or limitations. the proposed architecture will FULLY COVER the following requirements: - Integration with existing systems - API provision - High availability (99.9%) - Hosting in the European Union on SecNumCloud or equivalent infrastructure - Strict compliance with GDPR PARTIALLY COVERED requirements include: - Response time less than 2 seconds, as our typical RAG p95 response time is 1800 ms, which may not always meet this threshold - Energy consumption reduction, as our can provide some optimization through quantization methods (INT8, INT4 - GPTQ), but the exact reduction percentage may vary NOT COVERED requirements include: - None explicitly mentioned in our company context, but our should be cautious about potential limitations related to specific business software or civil status systems integration, which might require additional evaluation." ;
