        ex:hasText "As a Security and Compliance Officer at our company's, I can confirm that our company's has experience with EU regulatory frameworks, including GDPR, EU AI Act, RGS, SecNumCloud, and NIS2. our company's hold certifications such as ISO 27001, which covers the design, development, and operation of AI-powered information systems, and our company's have a Data Protection Officer (DPO) appointed." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk84> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To demonstrate compliance with GDPR, our company's can leverage our company's existing data protection measures, including encryption and anonymization tools like Microsoft Presidio and custom NER models. our company's also have experience with data subject rights implementation, including access, rectification, erasure, portability, and objection. our company's Data Protection Impact Assessment (DPIA) capability will help identify and mitigate potential risks." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk85> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regarding sovereignty constraints, our company's standard data residency policy is set to EU only, and our company's have a cross-border transfer policy that prohibits transfers by default unless there's an explicit legal basis." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk86> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "This aligns with the client's requirements for data protection and sovereignty." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk87> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To provide explicability and transparency for recommendations or proposals issued by our company's AI solution, our company's can rely on our company's AI security controls, such as output PII redaction, adversarial input detection, and confidence threshold escalation. our AI security controls, such as output PII redaction, adversarial input detection, and confidence threshold escalation will help ensure that our AI solution provides reliable and trustworthy outputs." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk88> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, I must note that our company's do have some known compliance constraints, including the risk of open API integration, LDAP/AD integration risks, and AI training data restrictions." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk89> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To mitigate some known compliance constraints, including the risk of open API integration, LDAP/AD integration risks, and AI training data restrictions, our company's can implement additional security measures, such as firewall rule hardening, privilege escalation audits, and anonymization of training data." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk9> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The generated contents will have to be adapted to the administrative context and compliant with the requirements of quality expected. 3.3 Assistance with the instruction of files The expected solution will have to be in measure to assist the agents in the analysis and the processing of files, by: proposing relevant information, recalling the applicable rules, suggesting actions or verifications to carry out." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk90> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Overall, our company's has a strong foundation in GDPR compliance, sovereignty, and explicability, which will help demonstrate our company's ability to meet the client's requirements." ;
